# The scenario editor's team members dialog, where a mouse button held on a
# picture counts that member up: once at the press, once more after a pause,
# then faster for as long as it is held. A right click takes one off. Then the
# team's name box: Backspace, typing and Return.
# args: -EDITOR
at 201 rclick 400 150
at 241 key DOWN
at 245 key DOWN
at 249 key DOWN
at 253 key DOWN
at 257 key DOWN
at 261 key DOWN
at 271 key RETURN
at 311 key DOWN
at 315 key DOWN
at 320 key RETURN
at 361 click 160 225
# The Members button; the pointer is then on the first picture, the rifle
# infantry. A press counts only for the picture the pointer already rests on.
at 401 click 57 43
at 441 press 57 43
at 444 shot first_step
at 460 shot before_repeat
at 520 shot repeating
at 521 release 57 43
at 560 shot released
at 561 rclick 57 43
at 600 shot one_less
at 601 move 250 150
at 641 press 250 150
at 700 release 250 150
at 740 shot second_member
at 741 click 290 373
at 800 shot team_with_members
at 801 click 55 31
at 820 key BACKSPACE
at 824 key BACKSPACE
at 840 shot name_erased
at 841 type AB7
at 880 shot name_typed
at 881 key RETURN
at 900 click 288 225
at 940 shot team_list
at 941 quit
